nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p032:m0154","start":154,"end":156,"surface":"叔獻","kind":"person","person_id":"gy7_lbd_q1p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p032:m0171","start":171,"end":173,"surface":"世祖","kind":"person","person_id":"kix_r92_2ed","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p032:m0185","start":185,"end":187,"surface":"劉楷","kind":"person","person_id":"jnv_f5v_nr2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p032:m0208","start":208,"end":210,"surface":"叔獻","kind":"person","person_id":"gy7_lbd_q1p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p032:m0234","start":234,"end":236,"surface":"世祖","kind":"person","person_id":"kix_r92_2ed","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p032:m0239","start":239,"end":241,"surface":"叔獻","kind":"person","person_id":"gy7_lbd_q1p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p032:m0243","start":243,"end":244,"surface":"楷","kind":"person","person_id":"jnv_f5v_nr2","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-058","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete-ws2638629"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p033","text":"六年，以始興太守房法乘代楷。法乘至鎮，屬疾不理事，專好讀書。長史伏登之因此擅權，改易將吏，不令法乘知。錄事房季文白之，法乘大怒，繫登之於獄。十餘日，登之厚賂法乘妹夫崔景叔得出，將部曲襲州執法乘，謂之曰：「使君既有疾，不宜勞。」囚之別室。法乘無事，復就登之求書讀，登之曰：「使君靜處猶恐動疾，豈可看書。」遂不與。乃啟法乘心疾動，不任視事，世祖仍以登之為交州刺史。法乘還至嶺而卒。法乘，清河人。昇明中，為太祖驃騎中兵，至左中郎將。性方簡，身長八尺三寸，行出人上，常自俯屈。青州刺史明慶符亦長與法乘等，朝廷唯此二人。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":84,"last_line":84,"raw_start":7441,"raw_end":7696,"raw_character_offsets":[7441,7442,7443,7444,7445,7446,7447,7448,7449,7450,7451,7452,7453,7454,7455,7456,7457,7458,